    "body": "Re-gated (scripts/gate.sh quick upstream/main on the merge with main at #405): tools, sim and app suites are green after cfcdde5. That commit loosens a version pin from #316: `setup_relative` asserted `PROJECT_VERSION == 56`, so it failed at v57 although setup links still round-trip. It now asserts the v56 floor, as #344 did for the probe test. Ready again.\n\n**Note for the maintainer:** this is the third time another PR's project-version rung has landed first (v54 #354, v55 #343, v56 #316), and each time this branch renumbers and re-gates. Merging #381 (and #395 / #399 on it) soon would stop the churn.",
